  dialogueLines:
  - the car broke down...
  - we need to find a drive belt to fix it...
  - i saw some tools in the backseat that might help you...
  - i also saw a food truck further down the road...maybe they can help also...
  - be careful though...there are small forest spirits nearby...
  - i can sense that they do not want me passing through here...
